WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.144 --> 00:00:17.536
"I know, Waldo," Ben said.

2
00:00:17.556 --> 00:00:20.598
"The whole school is under quarantine.

3
00:00:21.398 --> 00:00:22.459
Plus, we're just kids.

4
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.962
So how can we solve the mystery at Monster Academy?"

5
00:00:26.842 --> 00:00:28.604
"I don't know yet," Waldo admitted.

6
00:00:29.388 --> 00:00:32.391
"But what if it was my potion that caused the fog during the dance?"

7
00:00:33.431 --> 00:00:36.554
His glasses slipped down his nose, and he pushed them back up.

8
00:00:37.775 --> 00:00:41.338
"Maybe the fog from the lab traveled through the air vents to the gymnasium."

9
00:00:41.358 --> 00:00:47.623
"Could be," Ben murmured, remembering the fog inside the lab.

10
00:00:47.643 --> 00:00:50.826
"So you realize what this means, right?"

11
00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:51.887
said Waldo.

12
00:00:51.907 --> 00:00:54.469
"The epidemic is all my fault!"

13
00:00:54.489 --> 00:00:58.312
"It's not your fault, Waldo," Ben replied.

14
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:04.163
"If the flu was caused by the fog from the lab, then it's someone else's fault—the monster who

15
00:01:04.243 --> 00:01:05.444
ruined your experiment."

16
00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:09.066
Waldo nodded, looking a little relieved.

17
00:01:09.086 --> 00:01:11.327
"Maybe you're right.

18
00:01:12.788 --> 00:01:14.289
But sometime soon Mr.

19
00:01:14.349 --> 00:01:16.911
Freaky or the nurse will trace the flu back to the lab.

20
00:01:17.691 --> 00:01:19.052
And then I'm in big trouble."

21
00:01:19.072 --> 00:01:25.556
"Well, maybe we can try to find out who tampered with your experiment," said Ben.

22
00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.682
"We could find the guilty monster and make him or her confess."

23
00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:32.943
"That's what I was thinking too," said Waldo.

24
00:01:32.964 --> 00:01:36.425
"First we have to figure out what we know—all the facts.

25
00:01:38.246 --> 00:01:41.248
Then we can use those facts to figure out who our culprit is.

26
00:01:42.048 --> 00:01:44.089
We know that there was fog in the lab."

27
00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:49.472
"Another fact is that someone removed the hoses from your test tubes," Ben added.

28
00:01:49.492 --> 00:01:53.675
"And we also know that purple fog filled the gym during the dance."

29
00:01:54.675 --> 00:01:56.176
"Good," said Waldo.

30
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:01.144
"Here are some more things we know: both my potion and the fog were purple.

31
00:02:01.924 --> 00:02:04.386
And now everybody in Monster Academy is purple."

32
00:02:04.406 --> 00:02:08.690
"And nobody was sick before the dance," added Ben.

33
00:02:09.851 --> 00:02:11.513
Suddenly Waldo's eyes lit up.

34
00:02:11.533 --> 00:02:13.494
"Actually, that's not true!

35
00:02:14.816 --> 00:02:19.039
Miss Bungle has been sick since before the dance—before my potion caused that fog."

36
00:02:19.059 --> 00:02:22.182
"You're right," said Ben thoughtfully.

37
00:02:22.202 --> 00:02:24.284
"I forgot about that.

38
00:02:25.056 --> 00:02:28.179
Hey! Maybe your potion didn't cause this epidemic at all!"

39
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.941
Just then they heard voices.

40
00:02:34.825 --> 00:02:36.887
They looked over the railing and saw Mr.

41
00:02:36.947 --> 00:02:38.548
Freaky at the bottom of the stairs.

42
00:02:39.229 --> 00:02:42.312
The principal was with a tall human in a white coverall.

43
00:02:43.372 --> 00:02:46.175
The man was wearing a mask and carrying a clipboard.

44
00:02:46.195 --> 00:02:51.520
"That man must be the health inspector from People Place," Ben whispered.

45
00:02:52.532 --> 00:02:55.753
"So you have no idea how this epidemic started?"

46
00:02:56.114 --> 00:02:57.594
the health inspector said to Mr.

47
00:02:57.634 --> 00:03:00.175
Freaky. "No," said Mr.

48
00:03:00.215 --> 00:03:01.696
Freaky, wringing his hands.

49
00:03:01.716 --> 00:03:05.758
"But trust me—I will find out what caused it.

50
00:03:06.538 --> 00:03:08.619
Mayor Hubbletree has nothing to worry about.

51
00:03:09.659 --> 00:03:13.161
Everything in Monster Academy is totally under control."

52
00:03:14.121 --> 00:03:15.962
The health inspector sounded doubtful.

53
00:03:15.982 --> 00:03:20.504
"It doesn't appear that things are totally under control here.

54
00:03:21.464 --> 00:03:22.765
Everybody is purple.

55
00:03:23.365 --> 00:03:25.546
Nobody in People Place is purple.

56
00:03:26.347 --> 00:03:29.969
Now, that's a place where things are totally under control."

57
00:03:31.069 --> 00:03:34.011
Mr. Freaky took out his handkerchief and blew his noses.

58
00:03:41.975 --> 00:03:43.476
did the epidemic start?"

59
00:03:43.896 --> 00:03:45.137
asked the health inspector.

60
00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:50.080
"Who was the first person, er, monster to get sick?"

61
00:03:51.336 --> 00:03:53.197
Mr. Freaky put away the handkerchief.

62
00:03:53.217 --> 00:03:55.639
"The first monster?

63
00:03:55.659 --> 00:04:01.063
Hmm, let's see That would be Miss Bungle, our broom-flying instructor."

64
00:04:02.064 --> 00:04:05.186
Ben and Waldo looked at each other and smiled proudly.

65
00:04:06.086 --> 00:04:08.308
The two of them had just remembered this fact.

66
00:04:08.328 --> 00:04:11.190
"And where is she?"

67
00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.851
asked the health inspector.

68
00:04:12.871 --> 00:04:15.493
"She's at home," said Mr.

69
00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:19.196
Freaky. The health inspector made a note on his clipboard.

70
00:04:20.692 --> 00:04:21.832
"Show me the cafeteria.

71
00:04:22.493 --> 00:04:25.153
A lot of health problems occur where food is prepared.

72
00:04:26.074 --> 00:04:28.014
I want to see what you monsters are cooking."

73
00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:30.415
"Of course," said Mr.

74
00:04:30.455 --> 00:04:32.295
Freaky. "Follow me."

75
00:04:36.696 --> 00:04:38.477
Waldo looked at Ben and grinned.

76
00:04:38.497 --> 00:04:44.398
"Whew!" "I don't think you have anything to worry about, Waldo," said Ben.

77
00:04:44.418 --> 00:04:49.820
"The health inspector will figure out what caused the epidemic, and then someone will find a cure."

78
00:04:54.112 --> 00:04:54.992
Ben sighed.

79
00:04:55.012 --> 00:04:58.273
"I still have a problem though.

80
00:04:59.654 --> 00:05:00.914
Winnie's still mad at me."

81
00:05:03.374 --> 00:05:05.895
"I'll help you explain things to her," Waldo offered.

82
00:05:05.915 --> 00:05:08.236
"Come on, let's go find her right now."

83
00:05:12.417 --> 00:05:14.818
Ben and Waldo went downstairs to look for Winnie.

84
00:05:15.838 --> 00:05:19.899
As they passed through the lobby, a door opened, and in walked Miss Bungle!

85
00:05:20.699 --> 00:05:23.780
The ogre who worked in the main office rushed into the lobby.

86
00:05:25.108 --> 00:05:25.868
"Miss Bungle!

87
00:05:26.248 --> 00:05:27.889
You can't enter the building!

88
00:05:28.729 --> 00:05:31.050
Monster Academy is under quarantine!"

89
00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.890
The broom-flying teacher halted.

90
00:05:35.011 --> 00:05:38.452
She looked quizzically at the office ogre, and then at Ben and Waldo.

91
00:05:38.472 --> 00:05:42.753
"Why are you all purple?"

92
00:05:42.773 --> 00:05:45.174
"There's an epidemic.

93
00:05:45.834 --> 00:05:47.414
And a quarantine!"

94
00:05:47.834 --> 00:05:48.794
the ogre repeated.

95
00:05:48.814 --> 00:05:51.355
"You have to leave at once!"

96
00:05:52.475 --> 00:05:54.016
Waldo stared at Miss Bungle.

97
00:05:55.464 --> 00:05:57.326
"Wait a second," he murmured.

98
00:05:57.346 --> 00:06:00.410
"Why are you surprised that we're all purple?

99
00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.852
You've been sick with the flu all week.

100
00:06:03.413 --> 00:06:04.514
Didn't you turn purple too?"

101
00:06:05.515 --> 00:06:06.897
Miss Bungle shook her head.

102
00:06:06.917 --> 00:06:15.526
"No, I just had a minor case of monster flu—you know, sore throat, achy joints, and small green

103
00:06:15.606 --> 00:06:16.086
spots."
